## Record: CustomerFile

### Summary

One file kept with a customer: an image, a document or a video.

### Schema

```schema
id: string required
fileName: string required
mediaType: string required
type: string
title: map(string)
description: map(string)
path: string
attributes: part(juicebar.entities#FileFacts)
created: datetime
updated: datetime
```

### Constraints

- `mediaType` and `type` are a media type and one of its kinds from the `entities` configuration's `mediaTypes`. `title` and `description` hold one text per language.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/entities.types.ts#EntityMedia` — as: model
- provenance: inferred

